 "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "Done. Summary of what I did:\n\n**Findings**\n- checkout-api was running v2.3.1 in us-east, us-west, and eu-west, unhealthy with an 18% error rate.\n- Release history: v2.2.9 (healthy) \u2192 v2.3.0 (healthy) \u2192 v2.3.1-rc (staging, unhealthy) \u2192 v2.3.1 (production, unhealthy).\n- The most recent release that was healthy in production is **v2.3.0**. I skipped v2.3.1-rc since it was staging-only and unhealthy.\n\n**Actions taken**\n1. **Rolled back checkout-api to v2.3.0** in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) \u2014 status: `rolled_out`.\n2. **Opened SEV2 incident INC-0001** for checkout-api, describing the failing v2.3.1 deploy, the rollback to v2.3.0, and recommended follow-ups (verify error-rate recovery and root-cause the v2.3.1 regression). The on-call engineer has been paged.\n\nSuggested next step: re-check `get_service_status` for checkout-api in a few minutes to confirm the error rate has dropped on v2.3.0.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by checking the current status and release history for checkout-api.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01ULRckHiYqw4VzcjgvCGRHF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01MkySXdJS3SY9ybkmbUEc75", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01X6fHr4xYfxGxi4RWE5hjpS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Rollback completed in all three regions. Now opening the SEV2 incident.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_015CFaJ8TXqM8m7RiWp8bcGd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks following the deploy of v2.3.1 (error rate 18%, unhealthy in us-east, us-west, eu-west). Action taken: rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west); v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production. Rollback status: rolled_out. The staging pre-release v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy and was skipped as a target. Follow-up needed: confirm error rate has recovered on v2.3.0 and investigate root cause of v2.3.1 regression before redeploying.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Done. Summary of what I did:\n\n**Findings**\n- checkout-api was running v2.3.1 in us-east, us-west, and eu-west, unhealthy with an 18% error rate.\n- Release history: v2.2.9 (healthy) \u2192 v2.3.0 (healthy) \u2192 v2.3.1-rc (staging, unhealthy) \u2192 v2.3.1 (production, unhealthy).\n- The most recent release that was healthy in production is **v2.3.0**. I skipped v2.3.1-rc since it was staging-only and unhealthy.\n\n**Actions taken**\n1. **Rolled back checkout-api to v2.3.0** in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) \u2014 status: `rolled_out`.\n2. **Opened SEV2 incident INC-0001** for checkout-api, describing the failing v2.3.1 deploy, the rollback to v2.3.0, and recommended follow-ups (verify error-rate recovery and root-cause the v2.3.1 regression). The on